codex
Both claimed PDFs are false positives for this fire’s real-ingest contract: one reports rat spleen iron after millet milk feeding, and the other is an aluminum-chloride rat AD model treated with rivastigmine chitosan nanoparticles. Neither provides product/supply-chain heavy-metal occurrence data or a metal-removal/remediation intervention, so I’m recording them as skips rather than creating placeholder source pages.
